### ==========================================
### CREATE DEVLOGS
### ==========================================

POST {{url}}/devlogs
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Initial Development Log",
  "subtitle": "Setting up the core architecture",
  "content": "Today we established the database schemas, basic controller structures, and authentication pipeline."
}

###

POST {{url}}/devlogs
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring Endpoints and Validation",
  "subtitle": "Improving exception handling and controller logic",
  "content": "Replaced generic runtime exceptions with structured ApiExceptions for clean 400 Bad Request responses."
}

###

### ==========================================
### READ DEVLOGS
### ==========================================

GET {{url}}/devlogs/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{url}}/devlogs
Authorization: {{JWT}}
