### ==========================================
### UPDATE DEVLOG
### ==========================================

PUT {{url}}/devlogs/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Devlog Title",
  "subtitle": "Updated architecture notes",
  "content": "Revised documentation on endpoint routing and security middleware configuration."
}

